"வயினானே","gloss":"in your case"}],"gloss":"in your case","split_unverified":true}]}],"literal":"Boulder nearby's māṇai dark-creeper / sleeping male-elephant climbs hill country-lord / heart witness as, \"I will not leave you, I\" thus / good shoulders embraced time, then he / unfailing solemn-vow spoke / is it painful, O friend, in your side?","translation":"In the country of the mountain lord, the dark māṇai creeper growing near a boulder climbs onto a sleeping elephant, mistaking it for a rock. When he embraced my beautiful shoulders, he made an unfailing vow, saying, \"With my heart as witness, I shall never leave you.\" Why then, my friend, does it cause you such distress?","modern":"பாறையின் அருகில் இருக்கும் கரிய மாணைக்கொடி, தூங்குகின்ற ஆண் யானையின் மேல் ஏறும் மலைநாட்டைச் சேர்ந்த தலைவன், \"என் நெஞ்சமே சாட்சியாக நான் உன்னைப் பிரியமாட்டேன்\" என்று என் அழகிய தோள்களைத் தழுவியபோது செய்த தவறாத சூளுரை, தோழியே, உனக்கு ஏன் துன்பத்தைத் தருகிறது?","explanation":"The heroine (Thalaivi) is speaking to her friend (Thōḻi) in a Kuriñci (mountainous) landscape. The friend is deeply worried about the hero's delay in returning to marry the heroine, fearing he might have forgotten his promises. The heroine reassures her friend by recalling the solemn, unfailing vow (vañciṉam) the hero made when they first embraced, with his own heart (neñcu) as the witness. She describes his mountain country where a dark māṇai creeper climbs over a sleeping elephant, mistaking it for a boulder. This image suggests that just as the creeper trustingly clings to the elephant, she trustingly clings to the hero, and his vow remains firm. Therefore, she asks her friend why she is unnecessarily suffering from worry.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.36],[0.36,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.3,1.9],[2.1,3.27],[3.27,3.6],[3.6,3.9],[3.9,4.3],[4.3,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.67],[6.83,7.3],[7.3,7.54],[7.78,8.5],[8.98,9.7],[9.7,10.2],[10.2,11.5],[11.5,11.65],[11.65,12.3],[12.3,13.8],[13.8,14.0],[14.0,14.6],[14.82,15.2]],"female":[[0.0,0.36],[0.36,1.1],[1.1,1.5],[1.5,1.9],[2.08,3.32],[3.65,3.9],[3.9,4.3],[4.3,4.7],[4.7,5.2],[5.2,6.2],[6.7,7.7],[7.7,7.7],[7.7,7.7],[7.7,9.9],[9.9,10.4],[10.4,11.0],[11.0,12.4],[12.4,12.47],[12.47,13.1],[13.1,14.8],[14.8,14.9],[14.9,15.58],[15.58,16.0]]}}